<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-16452] IndexQuery can run on non-ready dynamically created index or rebuilding indexes</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-16452</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;IndexProcessor register dynamically created index earlier than fill it with data.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Then IndexQuery can reach the index before it actually ready. So we need to restrict access for such indexes.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The same behavior is for rebuilding indexes.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
